3	// The timeline — memos in chronological order (the stream has an order and an
4	// end). No counts, no ranking (#4). Each item is playable, likeable, and shows
5	// its transcript (on by default), which the author can correct. Filtered by the
6	// stream search query. All reachable by keyboard and screen reader.
